@namespace "sea_forge.interaction"
@version "0.1.0"

// Explanatory index for the "Interface projection bindings" section in
// interaction-model.sea. That section binds all 17 Workbench routes, every
// advertised SFWP method family, all visible major CLI entry points, and the
// implemented Thoth/delegation agent surfaces to existing CJ01-CJ12 IDs.
// Bindings are ordinary InterfaceProjection instances, never canonical journey
// identities or runtime availability claims beyond their cited evidence.
// This companion intentionally has no imports or semantic declarations because
// DomainForge 0.15.0 cannot resolve imported entity types for instances.
